{"id":"07679abb2816846c","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-exptime-notation.md","title":"73-df-exptime-notation — exptime notation","display":"73-df-exptime-notation — exptime notation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-exptime-notation","display":"73-df-exptime-notation — exptime notation","depends_on":["[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]"],"aliases":["73-df-exptime-notation","73-definition-10.6"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Automata Theory, Languages and Computation (Hopcroft, Ullman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-exptime-notation"},{"key":"display","html":"73-df-exptime-notation — exptime notation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-exptime-notation</span><span>73-definition-10.6</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TIME}\">\\(\\mathrm{TIME}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"995085b8741b47ae\" href=\"?note=995085b8741b47ae\" title=\"73-df-time-complexity-notation\">73-df-time-complexity-notation</a>；函数参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^k}\">\\(2^{n^k}\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\mapsto2^{n^k}\">\\(n\\mapsto2^{n^k}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^0=1\">\\(0^0=1\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EXPTIME}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TIME}(n\\mapsto2^{n^k})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EXPTIME}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TIME}(n\\mapsto2^{n^k})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-time-complexity-notation","status":"resolved","id":"995085b8741b47ae","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TIME}$ 见 [[73-df-time-complexity-notation]]；函数参数 $2^{n^k}$ 表示 $n\\mapsto2^{n^k}$，$0^0=1$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TIME}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\mapsto2^{n^k}","display":false},{"tex":"0^0=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.6}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EXPTIME}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{TIME}(n\\mapsto2^{n^k})","display":true}],"bytes":741,"backlinks":[{"id":"e452239d1f453972","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm P,\\mathrm{NP},\\mathrm{PSPACE},\\mathrm{EXPTIME}$ 分别见 [[73-df-p-notation]]、[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]、[[73-df-pspace-notation]]、[[73-df-exptime-notation]]；全部采用二进制词语言载体。"}],"outgoing":["995085b8741b47ae"]}